    <strong>All sessions: directional bias is noise.</strong> No session produces a t-statistic significant at even the 10% level. Every p-value is well above 0.05. The bull% for all sessions hovers around 49–50%, with the sole exception of NY/Sydney at 53.93% — but its t-stat of 0.21 (p=0.83) means even that is statistically indistinguishable from a coin flip given the small sample.<br><br>
